            "description": {
              "content": "The coding agent executes Python code in a sandboxed environment, fixes errors, and returns results. This interactive endpoint supports multi-turn conversations for iterative code development.\n\nStep 1: Submit code with prompt, get thread_id and execution result.\nStep 2: Continue with thread_id and resume=true to iterate on code.\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
